title Warlock Dreadsteed
category Collectibles
folder Mounts · Class
keywords Summon Dreadsteed, Mor'zul Bloodbringer, Dreadsteed of Xoroth, Dire Maul, Warlock, class mount
class Warlock
levels 60-60
zone Burning Steppes

# Summon Dreadsteed: your trainer's hand-off to Mor'zul Bloodbringer, then his
# long chain (named in the tip, not routed step by step).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (Mount: the spell
# is still a Forever mount; ItemSparse); quests.json and npcs.json for the
# chain.

step Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 60 Spackle Thornberry in the Slaughtered Lamb sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.
  level 60
  accept 7562 npc 5520

step Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf,Gnome,NightElf
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 60 Jubahl Corpseseeker in Ironforge sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.
  level 60
  accept 7562 npc 6382

step Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 60 Kurgul in the Cleft of Shadow sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.
  level 60
  accept 7562 npc 5815

step Mor'zul Bloodbringer (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 60 Martha Strain in the Magic Quarter sends you to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes.
  level 60
  accept 7562 npc 5753

step Mor'zul Bloodbringer
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip The Summon Dreadsteed chain is long and needs Dire Maul. After this hand-off: Rage of Blood (30 Raging Beast's Blood), Wildeyes, Lord Banehollow in Felwood, Ulathek the Traitor, Xorothian Stardust, Bell of Dethmoora (10 Elixir of Shadow Power), Wheel of the Black March (6 Large Brilliant Shards, 25 Dark Iron Ore), Doomsday Candle (35 Black Dragonscales), Arcanite (3 Arcanite Bars), Imp Delivery (J'eevee) and Dreadsteed of Xoroth, the ritual in Dire Maul.
  turnin 7562
  learn 23161 "Summon Dreadsteed"     -- Ticks once you finish the chain
